WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:10.180
Hello CZsWorld, and welcome to the first episode of a new web-series called True Fear.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:16.720
In this web-series I'm going to be stepping outside the world of fiction to talk about some real life scary stories that have happened in the world,

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:20.460
and I know that they're true because they've personally happened to me.

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:24.820
This episode will detail my late night run in with a creepy urban sleepwalker.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:28.180
...or at least that's what I thought was going on.

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:29.200
Here's how it went down.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:34.500
So it started when I was on my way home from my girlfriend at the time's house.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:39.200
She was going to visit family that weekend so I went up one last time to visit her before she left.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.060
So basically I ended up walking home pretty late at night.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:46.880
And also, this is not the best neighborhood. I've heard gunshots and apparently there's a meth issue.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:51.940
So I'm crossing the last intersection to get back to my apartment and there's just this guy standing there at the corner.

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:57.520
This guy had dark skin, he was wearing a dress shirt, he had a tie on, he had a messenger bag over his shoulder.

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:00.860
He was wearing black pants and he was just a pretty tall and intimidating figure.

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:04.140
I'm waiting for the light and I'm standing perpendicular to where he's standing.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.480
The light changes and he doesn't move.

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:11.940
I'm getting kind of nervous because I have to cross over this way and basically cross in front of him to get back to my apartment.

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:13.760
So all this stuff is going through my head, I'm thinking:

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:16.820
Is this guy going to mug me? Is he mentally ill? Is he insane?

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:19.200
It looks like he's just standing there waiting for me.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:22.540
So I cross the street, and as I get closer to him, I fell like he's going to say something to me.

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:26.760
I try not to make eye contact but I just get this feeling that he's just going to reach out and grab me or something.

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:31.160
As I cross in front of him I steal a glance and I notice that his eyes are just closed.

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:34.720
So I'm walking back to my apartment and I'm thinking, "what's going on with that guy?"

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:37.640
"That's pretty creepy that he's just standing there with his eyes closed."

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:40.060
And the idea that he was sleepwalking hadn't really come to me yet.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:42.720
I honestly just thought he was kind of a weirdo at this point.

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:48.020
As I get to my apartment I'm just thinking more and more about how weird that whole situation was.

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:53.060
I want to go and get some video evidence of it but I kind of doubt that the guy's still standing out there after quite a few minutes.

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:58.220
So I grab my roommate who is also into mysterious things, tell him about the situation, and we go to check it out.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:00.940
Sure enough, the guy has not moved whatsoever.

00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:04.080
So we get out there, we're behind him now, about 50 feet away.

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:08.420
And it's just quiet. It's 2 in the morning. There are no people out. There are no cars out.

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:13.180
We're keeping our voices down low so that he doesn't hear us if he is awake.

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:16.700
As we're debating whether or not to get closer, I snap a quick photo and video.

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:20.840
Now it's pretty far away, it's not the best evidence and it's at night so it's a little bit hard to see.

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:26.000
But the figure is just really creepy standing there at the end of the corner and it's the only evidence that I have from that night.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.980
So finally we decide, OK, we'll just walk forward, walk past him, see what happens. Check things out.

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:33.160
And as we get closer, the guy just drops.

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:35.640
And he catches himself with his left leg.

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:39.080
And he's almost in this stretching position like he's lunging to the left.

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:42.920
He gets to that position; and we just freeze, we're like, "OK, what's going on here?"

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:46.260
Then he proceeds to stick in that position for quite a while longer.

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:47.880
We're not exactly sure what to do.

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:52.880
And I know I should have gotten another picture at this part, but I honestly felt like this guy was going to turn around at any point.

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:57.780
So finally, we're waiting around a little bit, he doesn't do anything, and we decide to get closer again.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:05.720
And as we're walking up to him, he stands up, looks around, seems kind of confused, and then just starts walking forward across the street and disappears into the night.

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:10.940
We don't bother following him because at this point we figured whatever was going on with him,  he'd snapped out of it, he's woken up.

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:15.360
So this is when we came to the consensus that maybe he was sleepwalking.

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:18.720
Maybe we was just walking home from his second job or something...

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:23.240
He was really tired. Got to the stop light. Closed his eyes and fell asleep standing up for a few minutes.

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:28.280
Or maybe he was just sleeping in his apartment and started sleepwalking all the way out to the street and just stopped there.

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:31.160
Though... that doesn't really explain the attire he was wearing.

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:34.900
I contacted my old roommate recently to see if he had any recollections about the night,

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:39.820
and he suggested that it may have been drugs, and looking back on it, I think that's kind of a theory that makes sense.

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:41.480
Leave your theory in the comments though!

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:44.300
But what's really scary to me is to think about what could have been.

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:49.640
For example, what if this guy had stopped walking a few feet forward and just stopped in the middle of the street?

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:54.240
Or what if he really was mentally ill and dangerous and I just happened to walk by when his eyes were closed?

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:58.280
Or what if he was sleepwalking and he would have walked by right when I was going by and freaked out?

00:03:58.280 --> 00:03:59.520
Who knows what would have happened to me?

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:05.260
So I was really interested in this and for a few nights after that I went out around the same time to check and see if he was there.

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.900
To see if this was like a common habit that maybe he's sleepwalking at the same time every night.

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:10.480
But I never saw him out there again.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:13.900
I did, however, see other things... which were perhaps more scary.

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:18.120
Which I'll talk about in the next episode of True Fear, so subscribe if you have not already.

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:21.280
Also, special shoutout to my buddy WestDakota for helping me film this video.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.540
Go check out his channel, he does daily vlogs.

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:26.780
But like, don't just not check it out, actually go check it out.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.960
Dakota: Click right here on my face.

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:30.320
Get out of here.

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:34.540
If you liked this video, remember to like this video, and I'll see you in the next one.

00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:36.700
Assuming we both survive.

